--- forming a request
method with a space:  not of the expected form
target with a space:  not of the expected form
a GET of /ok:         no error
field name with a space: not of the expected form
value carrying CRLF:  not of the expected form
body carrying a null: not of the expected form
past MaxHeaders:      no room left
sending without Host: not of the expected form

listen:  no error
service: no error, a port was given: TRUE

--- GET, 200, Content-Length
send:    no error
  > GET /hello HTTP/1.1
  > Host: localhost
  > Accept: text/plain
  > Connection: close
receive: no error
  status 200 [OK]
  fields 2, stated 12, chunked FALSE, byClose FALSE
    Content-Type = [text/plain]
    Content-Length = [12]
    body 1: [hello]
    body 2: [world]

--- POST with a body, 404, and the field lookup
send:    no error
  > POST /submit HTTP/1.1
  > Host: localhost
  > Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
  > Connection: close
  > Content-Length: 8
  > (body) a=1&b=2
receive: no error
  status 404 [Not Found]
  fields 4, stated 0, chunked FALSE, byClose FALSE
    X-Empty = []
    Set-Cookie = [a=1]
    Set-Cookie = [b=2]
    Content-Length = [0]
  a 404 is not a failure: TRUE
  set-COOKIE = [a=1] (the first)
  x-empty was sent, and its value is []
  x-missing absent: TRUE, or [a default]

--- chunked, and Exchange
receive: no error
  status 200 [OK]
  fields 1, stated -1, chunked TRUE, byClose FALSE
    Transfer-Encoding = [chunked]
    body 1: [hello ]
    body 2: [a]
    body 3: [b]
    body 4: [world]
  joined: no error [hello 
a
b
world]
  into four characters: no room left, still [keep]

--- 302, not followed
receive: no error
  status 302, Location [/elsewhere] -- the caller decides

--- HEAD, whose response states a length it does not send
receive: no error
  status 200 [OK]
  fields 1, stated 42, chunked FALSE, byClose FALSE
    Content-Length = [42]

--- no Content-Length and no Transfer-Encoding
receive: no error
  status 200 [OK]
  fields 0, stated -1, chunked FALSE, byClose TRUE
    body 1: [read until the far end closes]

--- what is reported rather than guessed at
status-line with no code:   not of the expected form
field-line with no colon:   not of the expected form
framed both ways at once:   not of the expected form
closed without answering:   not present
a body line too long:       no room left
